# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING in vault/ is ever committed.
#   vault/app        - copy of Arc.app (proprietary binary)
#   vault/extracted  - Arc's assets, strings, WebUI (copyrighted)
#   vault/user-data  - personal profile: history, cookies, tabs, auth
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
